## 15. Common Backtracking Problems

Important problems include:

```text
Subsets
Subsequences
Permutations
Combinations
Combination Sum
N-Queens
Sudoku
Maze
Word Search
```

All of them involve exploring possible choices.

---

## 16. Backtracking Pattern Summary

### Subsets

```text
Include / Exclude
```

### Permutations

```text
Choose an unused element
```

### Combinations

```text
Choose elements from a forward position
```

### Combination Sum

```text
Choose elements
+
Control the target sum
```

### N-Queens

```text
Choose a board position
+
Check safety
```

### Sudoku

```text
Choose a number
+
Check validity
```

---

## 17. Complexity

Backtracking problems can have exponential or factorial complexity depending on the number of possible choices.

Examples:

| Problem         |        Approximate possibilities |
| --------------- | -------------------------------: |
| Subsets         |                            `2^N` |
| Permutations    |                             `N!` |
| Combinations    |                         `C(N,K)` |
| Combination Sum | Depends on target and candidates |
| N-Queens        |               Exponential in `N` |

Pruning can reduce the amount of work in practice.

